  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">African Climate Summit - Team Europe</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is a support to the Team Europe Pavilion at the African Climate Summit II (ACS II), to showcase  Team Europe&#x2019; s commitment, expertise and concrete contributions to Ethiopia&#x2019;s clean energy journey, fostering partnerships and mobilising further investment and collaboration. The side-event will highlight Team Europe&#x2019;s role as a strategic partner and investor in Ethiopia&#x2019;s green future through Global Gateway, contributing to deepening existing partnerships and creating new ones. The side event&#x2019;s geographic focus will be limited to programmes/investments in Ethiopia, confirming its bilateral nature. Given the nature of the ACS II, the focus will be exclusively on green initiatives.</narrative>
  </description>
